{"thought": "现有实现只接受 isdigit 十进制。添加十六进制分支：strip 后若 lower 以 '0x' 开头，校验剩余部分为非空纯十六进制数字，用 int(...,16) 转换；否则走原十进制校验。最后统一做范围检查。", "action": {"tool_name": "write_file", "args": {"path": "config_parser.py", "content": "def parse_port(raw):
    if not isinstance(raw, str):
        raise ValueError("port input must be a string")

    text = raw.strip()
    if not text:
        raise ValueError("port input is empty")

    lowered = text.lower()
    if lowered.startswith("0x"):
        digits = text[2:]
        if not digits or not all(c in "0123456789abcdefABCDEF" for c in digits):
            raise ValueError("invalid port format: %r" % raw)
        port = int(digits, 16)
    else:
        if not text.isdigit():
            raise ValueError("invalid port format: %r" % raw)
        port = int(text)

    if not (0 <= port <= 65535):
        raise ValueError("port out of range: %r" % raw)

    return port
"}}}

